2026-10-31T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2406) 'A login or token left on the desk lets anything there reach GitHub, and none of them is in 1Password.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2406  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2406) 'Run `security dump-keychain | grep github-app-4890712` and `gh auth status` on the desk: the first prints nothing and the second reports no account.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2406  1 LINE
