2026-10-31T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2406) 'the desk's stored GitHub credentials are destroyed
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2406  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2406) 'The desk's stored GitHub credentials, none of them in 1Password, are destroyed once the manifest repository and the avatar links exist. The Bao agent bundle in `~/.bao-creds` is not a GitHub credential and stays. Anything that needs GitHub after that is a release workflow, not the desk.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2406  1 LINE
 Text:Written

